### Colección de ejemplos (REST Client de VS Code / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
# Define demoPassword en tu entorno local del cliente HTTP (no la escribas aquí).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = pega-aqui-el-accessToken

### 1. Login (usuarios demo: supervisor@demo.local, operador@demo.local, auditor@demo.local)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "supervisor@demo.local", "password": "{{demoPassword}}"}

### 2. Usuario actual y sus bodegas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Productos (búsqueda por nombre, SKU o GTIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?q=arroz&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Ingreso con lote y vencimiento (recalcula el costo promedio)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movements/receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "referenceTypeCode": "01",
  "referenceNumber": "001-001-000001234",
  "reason": "Compra a proveedor",
  "lines": [
    {"productId": 1, "locationId": 2, "quantity": 50, "unitCost": 2.10, "lotNumber": "L-ARZ-09", "expiryDate": "2027-06-30"}
  ]
}

### 5. Egreso por FEFO (sin ubicación ni lote: el sistema asigna lo que vence antes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movements/issues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"warehouseId": 1, "referenceTypeCode": "PED", "referenceNumber": "PED-0200", "lines": [{"productId": 1, "quantity": 25}]}

### 6. Transferencia entre bodegas (una sola transacción)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movements/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sourceWarehouseId": 1, "targetWarehouseId": 2, "referenceTypeCode": "OT", "referenceNumber": "OT-0100",
 "lines": [{"productId": 1, "quantity": 10, "toLocationId": 13}]}

### 7. Kárdex valorizado de un producto
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/kardex?productId=1&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Kárdex en Excel
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/kardex/export?productId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Escaneo: GTIN, GS1-128/QR, GS1 Digital Link, QR de ubicación o SKU
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "https://id.example.com/01/09527001000019/10/L-ARZ-01?17=270630"}

### 10. Alertas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/expiring-lots?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Conteo cíclico: crear (ciego), contar, enviar y aprobar (otra persona)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cycle-counts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"warehouseId": 1, "aisle": "02", "notes": "Conteo semanal"}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/cycle-counts/1/lines/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"countedQuantity": 34, "note": "caja abierta"}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cycle-counts/1/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cycle-counts/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"notes": "Diferencia revisada con el jefe de bodega"}

### 12. Conciliación kárdex = stock = valorización
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/reconciliation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Bitácora de auditoría (ADMIN o AUDITOR)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-log?entityType=CycleCount
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
